{"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MISOCheckboxPicker","externalID":"s:14MISOComponents18MISOCheckboxPickerV","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOCheckboxPicker"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOCheckboxPicker","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"macOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false}],"symbolKind":"struct"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxPicker\/init(selections:checkboxes:placement:isReversed:isError:isReadOnly:hasDivider:itemsSpacing:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxPicker\/body"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties"},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxPicker\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxPicker\/View-Implementations"],"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOCheckboxPicker","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tag","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tag","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","level":2,"text":"Accessibility considerations","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Voice Over","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" will use several elements to describe the component: if component disabled \/ read only, if error context, the label and helper texts and a chekcbox trait."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The picker itself does no have any defined accessiiblity value, label or identifier ; it remains in the users hands to define which one will be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However if defined in the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioPickerData","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" the items inside the picker will have such accessibility identifiers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In addition the root item of the picker has for accessiiblity identifier the displayed text."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Forbidden-by-design","level":2,"text":"Forbidden by design","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxItem","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in both an error situation and a read only state."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxItem","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in both an error situation and a disabled state."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxItem","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in both a read only and a disabled state."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Code-samples","level":2,"text":"Code samples","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Define the elements to display in checkboxes using MISOCheckboxPickerData.","    \/\/ This object has the same properties as the MISOCheckboxItem,","    \/\/ and some of them are optional with default values set","    var someDataToPopulate: [MISOCheckboxPickerData<String>] {","        [","        MISOCheckboxPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_1\",","                                       label: \"Virgin Holy Lava\",","                                       description: \"No alcohol, only tasty flavors\",","                                       image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"flame\")),","","        MISOCheckboxPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_2\",","                                       label: \"IPA beer\",","                                       description: \"From Brewdog company\",","                                       image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"dog.fill\")),","","        MISOCheckboxPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_3\",","                                       label: \"Mineral water\",","                                       image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"waterbottle.fill\"))","        ]","    }","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selections: [String] = [\"Choice_1\"] \/\/ or empty if nothing selected","","    \/\/ Here the picker is vertical by default","    MISOCheckboxPicker(selections: $selections, checkboxes: someDataToPopulate)","","    \/\/ The picker can be vertical and have a root item with a label and a counter","    MISOCheckboxPicker(selections: $selections,","                       placement: .verticalRooted(label, .textAndCount))","","    \/\/ The picker can apply some settings to all its radio buttons.","    \/\/ It can be also horizontal with a scroll indicator.","    \/\/ Here all the the checkboxes are in read only mode and use reversed layout.","    \/\/ Here the picker is horizontal and shows the scroll indicator","    MISOCheckboxPicker(selections: $selections,","                       checkboxes: someDataToPopulate)","                       isReversed: true,","                       isReadOnly: true,","                       placement: .horizontal(true))"],"type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS 0.14.0","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misocheckboxpicker"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxPicker"},"abstract":[{"text":"A picker allowing to expose several checkboxes and select some of them within the others.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Each checkbox contains a “tag”, i.e. a supposed to be unique value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The picker will expose the choosen values using this “tag”.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It has also some configuration elements which will override the one applied to nested ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxItem","type":"reference"},{"text":" (divider, read only and error mode, layout a